{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_01",
  "title": "你的耳朵長不長？",
  "storyCode": "SL-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9fbc8ee701ff168c868afb9b7c7ad13fe38967ceaf2c10b8baa8b8310191fa4b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是誰在說話......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我啊，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，總覺得你應該已經習慣我在了，但想起來好像還從來沒有這樣對你說過話。不對，還是說過來著，唉，我已經忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是一朵厚重的雲從夜空裡輕飄飄地落了下來——\n渾身毛絨絨的生物，緩慢旋轉著身體，現身在阿黛爾的眼前。\n有一些輕巧，又有一些滑稽地落在了路邊的信箱上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好？晚上好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......小黑羊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你管我叫小黑羊？算了，也行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼這麼驚訝？我們也算見過的，應該是見過的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我以為，你......您是不會說話的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平時是不太會說話的。應該說，只有我會這樣講話，至於那些分身，他們大概是不太願意和人交流吧。或者是還沒有學會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，也不重要。現在我遇到了你，直接來找你說就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您......知道我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該怎麼說，我也算看著你長大的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，我可沒有偷窺別人的習慣。就是一種，簡單且單純的，陪伴。總之，我當然是對你有印象的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道在這裡遇見你算不算巧合，但畢竟是個難得的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起......我好像有點弄不清狀況......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，我能理解，小小的人類總是有問不完的問題——不用著急，我都會回答的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來聊聊吧，現在有時間嗎？我不太確定你這個年紀的孩子還用不用趕在某個時間點前回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經不是小孩子了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了，那就是說你有時間囉，想不想跟我去散散步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大水坑、大溫泉，還有白白的煙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你畫的不對！火山冒出來的是灰色的煙，汐斯塔可不是這個樣子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，那邊已經不再是汐斯塔了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們現在待的地方才是汐斯塔，大高樓那邊，可都是白色的煙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是汐斯塔，可是以前的汐斯塔，也還是汐斯塔啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，我知道了，就叫它老汐斯塔吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在的汐斯塔，應該是老汐斯塔的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老汐斯塔就像爸爸一樣，雖然現在離我們有點遠......但總有一天會回來，還會給我們帶禮物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們要什麼禮物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃尼斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打工結束了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噓——小點聲，哈莉已經睡著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小傢伙們，上次我和你們說什麼來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要晚上亂跑，不可以去移動城市外的箱子地塊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有不可以在畫紙之外的地方亂塗亂畫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我在餐廳後牆上看到的大作《赫爾曼是貝殼腦袋》，是誰畫上去的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是大人們都在這麼說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......實際上，大人們也不總是對的。所以我們三人的探險隊才是有意義的，我們能發現他們發現不了的寶物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是在那之前，明天把牆壁清理乾淨好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那看在你們承認錯誤的份上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年伸出手，三枚精緻的小土偶靜靜躺在手心，小巧精緻，臉上的表情栩栩如生，和桌子上擺著的全家福中洋溢著笑容的臉龐一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是我們探險小分隊新的信物了，一人一個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是從哪來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我自己做的哦~我說過，我會魔法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......不喜歡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（黎博利，菲林，佩洛......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（為什麼大家都不一樣呢......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實我更想要“D32鋼戰士”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是說過，貴重的禮物還是要放在更有紀念意義的日子嘛。別著急，想要的東西都在未來等著你呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，該回房間去睡覺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃尼斯，我們什麼時候才能回老汐斯塔呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在還不行哦。如果把它吵醒了，它會大發脾氣——噴出很可怕的火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許過段時間？等它心情好一點，不那麼氣鼓鼓的，我再帶你們去找它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也想像爸爸一樣，成為登山探險家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們比探險家還要厲害，我們有三個人，是個探險隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是探險隊！埃尼斯，到時候帶我們去挖“黑石頭”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸欸欸......不是說好了嗎，不要隨便說我去挖“黑石頭”的事情！要幫我保守秘密啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，可以帶我們去老汐斯塔的海濱樂園嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能到時候，海濱樂園已經變得破破爛爛的了......不過，我可以帶你們去找別的遊樂園呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別的地方也有水上樂園的，爸爸寄來的照片上不是有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好！火山和水上樂園，我們都要去！埃尼斯要說話算數！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說話算數！這是我們探險隊成員之間的約定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哥倫比亞合作商的貨物都裝運完畢，然後是萊塔尼亞那邊的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還得去確認一下博覽會展會場地的分區規劃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少爺，這麼晚了，該休息了。您沒必要對所有事情都親力親為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我靜不下來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡居民對物流中心建設的態度不算積極，希望透過舉辦這個跨國商品展覽會，能多少改變一點大家的態度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "汐斯塔作為獨立城邦，如果能利用好交通樞紐這個優勢，城市的發展是大有可為的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您也應該知道，人們很難認識到自己在這樣的變化中處在什麼樣的位置，大家擔心的只是未知的新生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我當然能理解。我還記得，小時候跟著父親從米諾斯搬走的時候，還大哭大鬧過一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生活是有慣性的，接受改變從來都不容易......我也希望，能讓大家開心一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽說您今天還約見了詩懷雅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然沒能達成什麼共識，但是她的話又提醒了我一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信使也好，商人也好，當你真的有能力，給別人的生活帶來很大的影響的時候，就要認識到這份責任的沉重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少爺，其實在我看來，您似乎沒有必要主動挑起這個擔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爺是對您寄予厚望，但他從來沒有要求過您過早地擔起這麼大的責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我永遠只按他的期望做事，那我永遠無法從他的蔭蔽下走出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "父親非常重視在汐斯塔的這個專案。這或許是他離成立峯馳物流最初的理想最近的一次機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且我理解，峯馳物流的根基畢竟在龍門，一舉一動都會有商業聯合會的桎梏。在汐斯塔子公司這件事上，父親有他的難處......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爺常常和我說起，離您能完全接手他的工作，大概還有五年時間。在那之前，他可以慢慢準備去雷姆必拓的退休計劃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在看來，他恐怕等不到那個時候就要被您早早取代了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不要打趣我了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過父親能早日退休，多去陪陪母親休養也是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你巴特勒，不過不用擔心我，趁現在我還有幹勁，趕快把任務做完吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣？玩得還開心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嚐了好多當地美食，還有這裡的人工溫泉，聽說和過去的火山溫泉的功效是一模一樣的，真的很舒服！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然沒有見到傳說中的黑曜石音樂節，但是也能感受到這裡熱情的氛圍，玩得很開心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯嘛，看來新汐斯塔也的確是一個很有商業潛力的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，你今天在外面，有沒有感覺到有人在盯著你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盯著我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別緊張，我就是隨便問問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要求一個普通人有反跟蹤的意識確實不太合理啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "詩懷雅小姐，這次來到汐斯塔，是帶著什麼秘密任務嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "任務？什麼任務？不是都說了，我就是簡簡單單來度假的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和近衛局接觸不多，但是聽說過一些詩懷雅小姐的故事，也聽說過詩懷雅小姐加入近衛局的動機，還有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有您的家族......我大概能夠想像，您做出這個決定有多麼困難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早知道就不該在面對記者的時候提這件事的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說來說去還是那一回事，真不知道小時候被恐怖分子綁架過有什麼好驕傲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還聽說，在陳警司離開後的兩年裡，近衛局一直都是詩懷雅小姐在把控局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我不太明白，為什麼現在詩懷雅小姐會以家族集團投資人的身份來到汐斯塔呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且......今天跟蹤我們的那幾個人，好像也是龍門人吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......還真是被問住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雪雉，你覺得，龍門是一個好地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......龍門是我的老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從當初離開龍門去哥倫比亞求學，再到回到龍門的這幾年，這座城市的變化歷歷在目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該怎麼說呢，看到那些每天都在新起的堅固的高樓大廈，作為一個工程學研究者，還是會感到非常欣慰的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是很堅固，只是有些......太過堅固了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "高樓大廈遮天蔽日，新生的事物就很難獲得發展所必要的陽光與養分了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "詩懷雅小姐，您是指......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，就當我胡言亂語吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才和你說的話，不要和別人提哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好像是走了很遠的一段路。\n龐大的生物在前面默不作聲地走著，它慢吞吞地向前挪動。阿黛爾跟在它的後面，時不時揉揉眼睛。\n一步，兩步，阿黛爾踩著自己的影子前行，身邊的路人對這突然出現的龐然大物卻都視若無睹......這真的不是夢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "孩子，你在看什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒、沒什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，我們不是散步嗎？我們......要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別著急，就快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抬頭，你看看那邊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一隻、兩隻、三隻......路燈下，一隻小獸停下腳步，安靜地抬起頭。\n月光下，毛絨絨的生物們在未建成地塊躍動、滾動。\n四隻、五隻、六隻......\n爛漫的燈光中，絨毛像是飛絮，飄散在空中。\n又像是星火，被吹落在這個無人知曉的夏夜。\n七隻、八隻、九隻......\n它們列隊整齊，跳過箱子，用蹄印在鐵皮上留下塗鴉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些，都是小黑羊嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小黑......不對，大黑羊先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，還沒有自我介紹過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形奇特的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用客氣，雖然我比你大很多，但是你可以直接叫我的名字。就叫我多利吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多利先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小時候，我聽過的一些童話故事裡，都說人快去世的時候，會看到一些奇怪的東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？有這回事嗎？真不明白現在那些大人都在給孩子們講些什麼沒品味的童話故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心孩子，現在還不到時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近過得怎麼樣？嗯......或許不該這麼問，可憐的孩子，看得出你過得並不太好，至少不是很健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這實在是沒什麼辦法的事......我為你感到惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "媽媽說，陪在我身邊的這些小羊是她送給我的禮物，是她請求您留在我身邊的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多利先生......您認識我的父親母親嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些小傢伙，解釋起來有些複雜。你就當作是我的分身就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過他們每一隻都與這個世界有特殊的聯繫，性格也不太一樣。他們願意跟在你身邊，至少說明你是一個受歡迎的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於你的爸爸媽媽，那當然是認識的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得很清楚，來自萊塔尼亞的那對年輕人，孜孜不倦地想要征服世界上的每一座火山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不得不說，就人類而言，想要在世界範圍內達成“每一個”的目標，都是愚蠢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是他們的目標是火山，這就不一樣了，是非常有品味的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很固執，但也很聰明，並且非常有審美！尤其是你的母親，她是我見過的少有的有智慧的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他們離去的時候......您也在他們身邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，這可真是不能輕易提起的沉重話題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還記得，那的確是意料之外的事，沒人知道火山會在那時爆發。話說回來，渺小的人類又怎麼能真的研究透關於世界的一切呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您也會為他們感到遺憾嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝天謝地，你沒有問我“為什麼沒有救下他們”這樣的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。我很喜歡火山，在沸騰的岩漿裡衝浪是這世界上第二快樂的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是火山也奪走了我的兩位好朋友的生命，這是近些年來發生的第十一糟糕的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們當然都想要避免一些糟糕的事情發生。但我其實沒有看上去那麼神通廣大，能做到的事也沒有那麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過你要是真的很難過的話，也可以揉一揉我的毛。一般來講，這樣對於緩解壞心情很有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一切過去的事都不會真的過去，它們總會換一種方式陪在你的身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迎面吹來的海風稍有暖意，一人一獸坐在海岸邊，靜靜聽著海浪聲響。\n毛絨絨的獸群安靜地進行著自己的遊戲，在貨櫃和攀爬架上來回跳躍，時而發出愜意的哼叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一隻小獸努力想要跟著眼前的隊伍爬上箱子，但屢屢失敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外形小巧的生物",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沮喪的叫聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我已經太久沒有這樣和你們人類坐下來慢慢聊天了。我的語言有點匱乏。所以我還是儘量省去一些客套話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起那些一眼能看到答案的問題，我更想問你——小傢伙，你現在過得開心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我在努力完成爸爸媽媽的研究。雖然很辛苦，但我相信自己現在的生活很有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也就是說，你現在還是不開心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難得在汐斯塔碰見你，我們來做一筆交易吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不對，我想想，在你們的語言裡，“交易”這個詞是這麼用的嗎？還是說應該用一個親切一點的詞來著......對了，是“遊戲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡而言之，我想讓你幫我找來幾樣東西，應該是我落在汐斯塔的。算是某種藏寶遊戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果您需要幫助的話......您丟的是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想想。是北風，種子，皮毛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這......都是什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提前揭曉謎底哪還能算是遊戲呢？不要急於追問答案，要多去感受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，不會白白辛苦你的。等你把這幾樣東西找齊的時候，我也會給你相對的報酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......就是你一直在找的東西，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要找的東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以就是這樣，北風，種子，皮毛，就有勞你幫我找齊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
